    "title": "Black Soldier Fly detection, phenotyping and sex prediction dataset",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.13359376",
    "publication_date": "2024-08-27",
    "description": "<p>BSF_Larvae for training the detection and segmentation model consists of 321 images with over 5000 larvae instances.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Single_Larvae_data consists of 1608 single larvae images for the measurement of body weight, length and width of the individual larva.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The Larvae size&nbsp; excel sheet contains the size and sex data corresponding to the individual larva.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The Larvae sex classification dataset includes images cropped from the Single_Larvae_data for sex classification.</p>",
